    <node id="a11y">
      <data key="d0">a11y</data>
      <data key="d1">other</data>
      <data key="d2">a11y, also known as accessibility, is a term deeply rooted in web development and digital content creation. It refers to various features designed to enhance the usability of web elements and applications for individuals with disabilities. This encompasses a range of attributes and terms used in web development to ensure that websites and digital content are accessible to people with different abilities. Specifically, a11y is a term commonly used in web development to denote accessibility-related features and attributes, including source attributes and other accessibility-related elements that contribute to making web content more usable and inclusive. Accessibility features for web applications are integral to ensuring that users can navigate and interact with digital content effectively, regardless of their physical or cognitive limitations. Additionally, there exists an organization associated with accessibility features, which further emphasizes the importance of a11y in the broader context of web development and usability.&lt;SEP&gt;Accessibility features for web elements&lt;SEP&gt;[source element] screen_id 'minicart_open' instruction click the link 'V8 +Energy, Healthy Energy Drink, Steady Energy from Black and Green Tea, Pomegranate Blueberry, 8 Ounce Can ,Pack of 24' role 'link' name 'V8 +Energy, Healthy Energy Drink, Steady Energy from Black and Green Tea, Pomegranate Blueberry, 8 Ounce Can ,Pack of 24' bbox_px '[273, 674, 500, 753]'</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-01c33fc069142df72db73c0a60322bcf-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-01c9fc9ee30d9a60fd968f838ea162d4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-025c703964dec2fe371e10c8415dd613-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0b695dbca7b0baea8472f4b9b8c77cc7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1abb292a251278234ef2aea5585a4cec-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1b896baf2b5d815d3bbe0eb625a72814-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1c39a269c840c652393b3da52117ee29-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1e69ba803ff29a691deb2111e022bb4d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2264c0cbd93197c10fe0a09fdbcf60f8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-323e293277d50c431bbc02b71c78a7a1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-336354e68363ca14a619dc9017f3722b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-36f6576613a283888b16c8f9146dbd71-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3881dc8d47b3676c7ac00352787e5b11-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3b63eb4098e5145f7df0c3032404516e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-45c24883b260d58ce196b2bd5813a10a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-53f6ded76ac80a02287a2f5e4d7808cb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-575df4d1d4a9a71fa3b40c1f3ed4f6be-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-57700c1ee10803d54cfcb11e805a1b9e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5ceb1c3b3128f0d47d1a8d177a4d6780-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-644571f9784ce04891f41845bd4a33cf-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f918084db54f057473db40beef298f2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6fdf98cdebdbf6d580bc571f0e63d026-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6fee16de15adef8f9c158fcdcfc3c3cf-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-79d9878ecf576fac1aa1aa6fe797867f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7b3dbaa1dc2bafcf6737861428b971a7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7ff218daa648cf801a7184502db5ca24-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-84bb4345d24d03ecc2f6b643d50ef2ec-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c4c0287492ac47c15df9071249fde66-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-93994d22ad00beec814080e416a51904-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-998ef6f2a08b055f4cea5fd640aa78ae-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9ecd5e9d22535ece235c555f4d9df437-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9fde1622ef828bc2735ced9dd67f3e79-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a01aa3869759c0df193b39c39a682dfb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ab0e24a021db35a260177d5f65789313-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afaeae3f07222d6abb05167120cb64e6-chun