      <data key="d3">doc-a01aa3869759c0df193b39c39a682dfb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b29ad775cde5b9e8e27a6d6eafeda4a8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b6a4ebc813bac50eb0d53c08cb4b08da-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-024b19b8de0d5b640f27f0a312da5ca5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0ecdec2685406dc115c811677c195f75-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1abb292a251278234ef2aea5585a4cec-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-269a8ede147006aea65d5f4620f825e3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-45c24883b260d58ce196b2bd5813a10a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-547a6ce3129ff5916eefb35f8a299993-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6862f8705f500b582cfb681d1c6febc9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-79bdc8c15be295419534818b640a1fab-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7b3dbaa1dc2bafcf6737861428b971a7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-96f37bc024c1dd81bce2be42d32fb9a4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9cf014a55715838cd2e7be449bd106f3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ab0e24a021db35a260177d5f65789313-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b64b5d11488f01f9fe0fa193ff7147e5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-323e293277d50c431bbc02b71c78a7a1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ba1791b7a2e156d3fdfe4a129ba66a73-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ba90d6ca176ed689081def0260ad0880-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bf0db5826ed0280c954ef6c7dc9c6466-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c02f14b1e32cdfab5456f0d0d6deb773-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cba959f3b1e47acab4a419f1afb756d1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce3a0782e39046b81c406c6b4e1edfff-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e0a00ecf4aa98abb75f058611cd0bfdf-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-575df4d1d4a9a71fa3b40c1f3ed4f6be-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e89442d6a67c299758956cf8985a34cb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ee53c6412436092f3c03b65b2173ad54-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f067742834b4ccdbde208903ac4ed06c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f437e42ae366198509c91f29b833f612-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f7718246a4863503f148e838eec9d4ca-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d2">The term "instruction" refers to various actions or commands designed to guide a user through a specific process or task. It can encompass a wide range of activities, including clicking on different elements such as buttons, menu items, links, and textboxes. Instructions are often part of a set of steps or commands intended to perform a particular action, such as changing a password. In this context, an instruction typically involves interacting with a user interface element by clicking on it, which could be a button, a menu item, a link, or a textbox.&lt;SEP&gt;An instruction to click a textbox element.&lt;SEP&gt;A set of directions or instructions.&lt;SEP&gt;An instruction to click a link named 'My Wish List'.&lt;SEP&gt;An instruction related to an action.&lt;SEP&gt;An instruction related to an&lt;SEP&gt;Instruction for interaction</data>
      <data key="d1">other</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1787055544</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="bbox_px">
      <data key="d0">bbox_px</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-b29ad775cde5b9e8e27a6d6eafeda4a8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b6a4ebc813bac50eb0d53c08cb4b08da-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-024b19b8de0d5b640f27f0a312da5ca5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0ecdec2685406dc115c811677c195f75-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-269a8ede147006aea65d5f4620f825e3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-547a6ce3129ff5916eefb35f8a299993-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-79bdc8c15be295419534818b640a1fab-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7b3dbaa1dc2bafcf6737861428b971a7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-96f37bc024c1dd81bce2be42d32fb9a4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9cf014a55715838cd2e7be449bd106f3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b64b5d11488f01f9fe0fa193ff7147e5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1abb292a251278234ef2aea5585a4cec-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-323e293277d50c431bbc02b71c78a7a1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-45c24883b260d58ce196b2bd5813a10a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ba1791b7a2e156d3fdfe4a129ba66a73-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ba90d6ca176ed689081def0260ad0880-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-bf0db5826ed0280c954ef6c7dc9c6466-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c02f14b1e32cdfab5456f0d0d6deb773-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cba959f3b1e47acab4a419f1afb756d1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce3a0782e39046b81c406c6b4e1edfff-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e0a00ecf4aa98abb75f058611cd0bfdf-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-575df4d1d4a9a71fa3b40c1f3ed4f6be-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e89442d6a67c299758956cf8985a34cb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ee53c6412436092f3c03b65b2173ad54-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f067742834b4ccdbde208903ac4ed06c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f437e42ae366198509c91f29b833f612-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f7718246a4863503f148e838eec9d4ca-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d2">The entity "bbox_px" refers to bounding box coordinates measured in pixels. These coordinates define the dimensions of an element within a graphical interface or image. Specifically, "bbox_px" encompasses the pixel coordinates that outline the boundaries of an object, ensuring precise placement and sizing. This attribute is crucial for various applications, including computer vision, graphic design, and user interface development, where accurate representation of elements is essential for functionality and aesthetics.&lt;SEP&gt;Pixel coordinates of the bounding box for the link 'My Wish List'.&lt;SEP&gt;Bounding box coordinates in pixel units.&lt;SEP&gt;Bounding box coordinates in pixels</data>
      <data key="d1">other</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1787055544</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="role">
      <data key="d0">role</data>
      <data key="d1">other</data>
      <data key="d2">Role refers to various designations assigned to elements within a system. It can denote the function or purpose of a component, such as a textbox, where its role might be to receive user input. Additionally, roles can specify the action to be taken, like linking to another page or performing a specific task. In some contexts, roles are attributes that describe the nature of an element, such as its function or intended use. The term "role" is versatile and can apply to different types of elements, including menu items, where it signifies the function or action associated with that item. Overall, the concept of role encompasses a broad range of meanings depending on the context, from indicating the action to be performed to defining the purpose or function of an element.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-01c33fc069142df72db73c0a60322bcf-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-01c9fc9ee30d9a60fd968f838ea162d4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-024b19b8de0d5b640f27f0a312da5ca5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-025c703964dec2fe371e10c8415dd613-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0ecdec2685406dc115c811677c195f75-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1abb292a251278234ef2aea5585a4cec-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1e69ba803ff29a691deb2111e022bb4d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2264c0cbd93197c10fe0a09fdbcf60f8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-269a8ede147006aea65d5f4620f825e3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-323e293277d50c431bbc02b71c78a7a1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-45c24883b260d58ce196b2bd5813a10a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-547a6ce3129ff5916eefb35f8a299993-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-575df4d1d4a9a71fa3b40c1f3ed4f6be-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-57700c1ee10803d54cfcb11e805a1b9e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6862f8705f500b582cfb681d1c6febc9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-79bdc8c15be295419534818b640a1fab-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7b3dbaa1dc2bafcf6737861428b971a7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8c4c0287492ac47c15df9071249fde66-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-93994d22ad00beec814080e416a51904-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-96f37bc024c1dd81bce2be42d32fb9a4-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9cf014a55715838cd2e7be449bd106f3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a01aa3869759c0df193b39c39a682dfb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ab0e24a021db35a260177d5f65789313-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-afaeae3f07222d6abb05167120cb64e6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b64b5d11488f01f9fe0fa193ff7147e5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e4dc81cdc7cc78005bebf5e2cebf18ae-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b6a4ebc813bac50eb0d53c08cb4b08da-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ba90d6ca176ed689081def0260ad0880-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cba959f3b1e47acab4a419f1afb756d1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ce3a0782e39046b81c406c6b4e1edfff-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e0a00ecf4aa98abb75f058611cd0bfdf-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e89442d6a67c299758956cf8985a34cb-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f067742834b4ccdbde208903ac4ed06c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f437e42ae366198509c91f29b833f612-chunk-000</data>
