    <node id="step">
      <data key="d0">step</data>
      <data key="d1">other</data>
      <data key="d2">A sequence number indicating a step in a process&lt;SEP&gt;A numbered stage in a sequence of actions.&lt;SEP&gt;A numbered stage within a sequence of actions.&lt;SEP&gt;Indicates the current stage or phase of the task.&lt;SEP&gt;A numbered indication of the current stage in a sequence of actions.&lt;SEP&gt;A numbered sequence indicating the progression of a task.</data>
