    <node id="url_after">
      <data key="d0">url_after</data>
      <data key="d1">other</data>
      <data key="d2">url_after refers to the URL of a resource or page that changes following an action or task completion. This term is used interchangeably to describe the URL after various actions have been executed, such as a transition, a task action, or simply an action being completed. It indicates the final destination or state of the URL post-action, reflecting the outcome of the interaction or process.&lt;SEP&gt;The URL of the page or resource accessed after an action.&lt;SEP&gt;The URL of the page after the action.&lt;SEP&gt;The URL after the action was completed.&lt;SEP&gt;The URL of the page after an action is completed.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-c03a55d3ed535c691cb634704db74a30-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e183c3bffbabc03a75bb2382164f1a11-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-14ceb1ebb14936f5b21a23a880dfeaca-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-37efc5c1445ce192ca1d962c1d8c91dc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6371d7766d8a30a1d8aedfb05c069ba8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-dd334441a53ee71d815874e2a4d2f7c9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fdd8eb5fe9d7ea8984fec9eb6c4e6878-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-189de8ba1f681a4ac020519f647f3544-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3df8bd91a6a3d0871e38317475d7b157-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5c82ff2039f325fb23b86afa8c23dcf2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-641918b0c83a0a355d25025600a88524-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-73c6da08c5ad531e9f5e932aac330047-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-756d823b08bd1c3abebceb95e49c808b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a27c3607ebcd1cbf634c7919d8b8e521-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
