    <node id="state">
      <data key="d0">state</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The entity referred to as "state" can be described as a geographical region within a country, characterized by a specific ID and various URLs associated with it. These URLs include a general URL, an electronics-specific URL, a sales order history URL, a login URL, and a contact URL. Additionally, there is a unique identifier mentioned for this state entity, which is '463507b849a4'. The state entity is consistently identified by its ID across different contexts, indicating a standardized representation within the system.&lt;SEP&gt;A state entity with the identifier '680c93c4dbc4'.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-0313cdbbf9e37e1899a0a0af02cdac29-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-56ee8cfaad4c3e7787c80d633f3b9fb2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1761098ff20f891ff04716299843abaf-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7aca32fb89c5bf0ba28f8edd9e43b4e5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80ff16dfcb43a231a5b62c9f95f56be9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8958b6983df1cc2819a9f3f0c180b996-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8d32db36985b997241737a36c8273ebf-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e7b4da8b6c531d24274ef4d30231b38a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f7e2f7ace4b7e7623955ea0f39973b12-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
