    <node id="task">
      <data key="d0">task</data>
      <data key="d1">other</data>
      <data key="d2">A task with ID 'search_open_first_product', which was successful, had 1 step, and its goal is to open a product detail page by clicking a product title or product link, ending with .html and not being a search results page.&lt;SEP&gt;A task with ID 'browse_category_to_subcategory', which was successful and completed in 2 steps, aiming to open the 'Electronics' category and navigate to 'Cell Phones &amp; Accessories'.&lt;SEP&gt;A task with ID 'login_to_account' that was successful, consisting of 1 step, aimed at logging in with the test customer account and opening My Account, starting from the URL 'https://reiterate-unnamable-upstroke.ngrok-free.dev/customer/account/login/'.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-2d0074974c4aa4f05a4fad3abaa22278-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6f31dbc98ece4cdaa913484ad6123833-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-77d1ef495926eda163315691e8b4e230-chunk-000</data>
