    <node id="title_after">
      <data key="d0">title_after</data>
      <data key="d1">other</data>
      <data key="d2">The title_after refers to the title of a resource or page following the completion of an action. This term can be applied to various contexts, such as the title of a resource after an action has been taken, the title of a page after a task action has been completed, or the title of a page after an action has been performed. It consistently denotes the updated title of a page or resource that has been accessed after an action has been executed.&lt;SEP&gt;The title of the page after the action.&lt;SEP&gt;The title after the action was completed.&lt;SEP&gt;The title of the page after an action is completed.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-14ceb1ebb14936f5b21a23a880dfeaca-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-37efc5c1445ce192ca1d962c1d8c91dc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6371d7766d8a30a1d8aedfb05c069ba8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-dd334441a53ee71d815874e2a4d2f7c9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-fdd8eb5fe9d7ea8984fec9eb6c4e6878-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-189de8ba1f681a4ac020519f647f3544-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3df8bd91a6a3d0871e38317475d7b157-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-5c82ff2039f325fb23b86afa8c23dcf2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-641918b0c83a0a355d25025600a88524-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-73c6da08c5ad531e9f5e932aac330047-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-756d823b08bd1c3abebceb95e49c808b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a27c3607ebcd1cbf634c7919d8b8e521-chunk-000</data>
