      <data key="d7">8.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The task identified as "guest_open_orders_returns" involved transitioning through various states. Initially, it began from the state "90d110975ccc" and progressed to the state "c62d5eb1b8fc". The task was successfully completed, and the final URL after its completion was "https://reiterate-unnamable-upstroke.ngrok-free.dev/sales/guest/form/", indicating the task's endpoint. The title after the task completion was "Orders and Returns", suggesting the task's purpose was related to managing guest orders and returns. Additionally, the task included a click action targeting a specific mark ID of 40, which was part of the process. This task was specifically designed to handle operations involving guest orders and returns, ensuring a seamless flow from start to finish.</data>
